    "Content": "Azure Batch Service has added MPI and offline node support.\n\nFor more information, see our blog post - <a href=\"https://blogs.technet.com/b/windowshpc/archive/2016/01/01/azure-batch-service-update-dec-2015.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Azure Batch Service Update - Dec. 2015</a>. Azure Batch client library has been updated to <a href=\"https://www.nuget.org/packages/Azure.Batch/3.0.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">3.0.0</a> for these new features.",
